cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - name: RakTikoo
title: "epochmatch: cross-match star catalogues from different epochs with proper-motion propagation"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-17
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/epochmatch"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/epochmatch"
abstract: >-
  Cross-matches two star catalogues measured at different epochs (CSV,
  VOTable or FITS tables) by propagating positions to a common epoch with
  proper motions before matching, and reports matched, unmatched and
  ambiguous pairs.
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - cross-match
  - proper motion
  - catalogue
